  "title": "Old Republic to Acquire Everett Cash Mutual",
  "summary": "Old Republic International Corporation (NYSE: ORI), our parent Company, today announced that it has entered into a definitive agreement, pending regulatory and policyholder approval, to acquire Everett Cash Mutual Insurance Co. and affiliated companies (\"ECM\") following its conversion to a stock company in a sponsored demutualization transaction.",
